{"3838290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Refate: Echoes of Desire", "steam_appid": 3838290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/4e2165771935d1d7a12363573e37153e.avif?t=1761137705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras_big/4e2165771935d1d7a12363573e37153e.avif?t=1761137705 width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The first immersive interactive movie game with a Yakuza theme.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first-person perspective scans the neon lights of a foreign city, your story begins with a &quot;brutal starting blow&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                    ——ReFATE：Echoes of Desire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes to an unfamiliar street scene, your pockets emptier than your mind—it's like someone hit the &quot;delete&quot; button on your memories. Survival is your only immediate KPI, but trouble always arrives faster than opportunities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows flicker in the dim light, gang members chase you with a urgency that outpaces your heartbeat. Don't panic. Staying alive is the first key to unlocking &quot;who I am&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting penniless and amnesiac on the streets of Tokyo, you will journey step by step to the city's pinnacle. Money, beauties, and power will all become byproducts of your search for the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[Special Note]</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major Premiere! Complete romance routes for 8 female protagonists!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[Game Features]</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[First-Person Immersive Yakuza Survival Play]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filmed with real Tokyo landmarks, includes &quot;you-know-what&quot; style easter egg scenes, featuring detailed performances by local popular actresses and seasoned actors. This first-person immersive Yakuza survival challenge, starting from the Tokyo streets, is officially beginning. You're not watching a story; you're telling your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Meaty QTE that Makes Your &quot;Heartbeat&quot; Tangible]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action QTEs that blend seamlessly with the live-action footage, turning a &quot;racing heartbeat&quot; into a playable rhythm. A tap of your finger might just switch you from a &quot;dead-end scenario&quot; to an &quot;awesome storyline&quot;. Every interaction is a deep connection with the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/2aa354395680abbf7373e4b501520f66.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/2aa354395680abbf7373e4b501520f66.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/2aa354395680abbf7373e4b501520f66.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Length + Rewards: Generous Volume]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes over 7 hours of live-action footage and 8 beautiful heroines with different charms and personalities. Whether it's length or... rewards, we offer generous volume.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The noble and cold Yakuza boss lady</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/3dd56656466a4c0b5920e85131cbf392.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/3dd56656466a4c0b5920e85131cbf392.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/3dd56656466a4c0b5920e85131cbf392.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The gentle and caring innocent international student</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/16b7633c15521d745c9512d6aace3501.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/16b7633c15521d745c9512d6aace3501.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/16b7633c15521d745c9512d6aace3501.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The quirky and mischievous little devil rich heiress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/b2e9a84e040ab0eb1577a42b9020a733.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/b2e9a84e040ab0eb1577a42b9020a733.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/b2e9a84e040ab0eb1577a42b9020a733.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The lonely divorced teacher with a child</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/53ae396211789694473be66f079ef780.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/53ae396211789694473be66f079ef780.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/53ae396211789694473be66f079ef780.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The vibrant and righteous policewoman</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/ecbfba1d8adf56ecb8eef42d325192aa.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/ecbfba1d8adf56ecb8eef42d325192aa.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/ecbfba1d8adf56ecb8eef42d325192aa.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The dangerous,well-proportioned female ninja</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/31c3d9e03726880580b48d0458b28ae9.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/31c3d9e03726880580b48d0458b28ae9.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/31c3d9e03726880580b48d0458b28ae9.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The enchanting top-tier gravure model</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/38024fd94f45957f91507b2d1e58d8b0.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/38024fd94f45957f91507b2d1e58d8b0.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/38024fd94f45957f91507b2d1e58d8b0.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The sexy and passionate restaurant owner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/46007fd837f92331adb8b4a5a5a6153d.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Suspense + Romance, the 'Chrysanthemum and the Sword']</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you're lingering in tender ambiguity, the next you're gasping, &quot;Who stabbed me in the back?!&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[High-Intensity Narrative + Highly Interactive Gameplay]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A professional production team delivers full cinematic quality. The suspenseful puzzle-solving will keep you focused, while the tense action sequences ensure the story's pace is perfectly balanced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Endings Feature Interwoven &quot;Dream Crossovers&quot;]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of branches lead to N types of lives. Among the dozen or so endings lie interconnected easter eggs. The more memory fragments you collect, the more you can uncover the hidden plot behind the main story—even the endings themselves interact and intertwine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Interaction is More Than Just &quot;Choose A or B&quot;]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During investigation phases, details that can turn the tide are hidden within the scenes—graffiti on a street corner, a special mark in a drawer, a seemingly ordinary diary... any could be the code to break the case.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Find Your Past, Piece Together Memories, Win Big or Restart—The Choice is Yours]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the path to discovering your history, memory fragments are like puzzles scattered throughout the plot. As you piece them together, you encounter the &quot;so-this-is-how-crazy-I-was&quot; version of yourself. Just dive in and make your choices. Choose right, and you win big in Tokyo. Choose wrong? Just hit restart—after all, a good story is never afraid of a few tries. Every restart is a new highlight moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/4ebeaafa0ed6dc5b5e92e8e6183ddfe5.avif?t=1761137705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras_big/4ebeaafa0ed6dc5b5e92e8e6183ddfe5.webp?t=1761137705 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/4e2165771935d1d7a12363573e37153e.avif?t=1761137705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras_big/4e2165771935d1d7a12363573e37153e.avif?t=1761137705 width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The first immersive interactive movie game with a Yakuza theme.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first-person perspective scans the neon lights of a foreign city, your story begins with a &quot;brutal starting blow&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                    ——ReFATE：Echoes of Desire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes to an unfamiliar street scene, your pockets emptier than your mind—it's like someone hit the &quot;delete&quot; button on your memories. Survival is your only immediate KPI, but trouble always arrives faster than opportunities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows flicker in the dim light, gang members chase you with a urgency that outpaces your heartbeat. Don't panic. Staying alive is the first key to unlocking &quot;who I am&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting penniless and amnesiac on the streets of Tokyo, you will journey step by step to the city's pinnacle. Money, beauties, and power will all become byproducts of your search for the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[Special Note]</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major Premiere! Complete romance routes for 8 female protagonists!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>[Game Features]</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[First-Person Immersive Yakuza Survival Play]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filmed with real Tokyo landmarks, includes &quot;you-know-what&quot; style easter egg scenes, featuring detailed performances by local popular actresses and seasoned actors. This first-person immersive Yakuza survival challenge, starting from the Tokyo streets, is officially beginning. You're not watching a story; you're telling your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.poster.avif?t=1761137705\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.webm?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extras/593c2ee0e6168fd78062c086a5551121.mp4?t=1761137705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Meaty QTE that Makes Your &quot;Heartbeat&quot; Tangible]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action QTEs that blend seamlessly with the live-action footage, turning a &quot;racing heartbeat&quot; into a playable rhythm. A tap of your finger might just switch you from a &quot;dead-end scenario&quot; to an &quot;awesome storyline&quot;. Every interaction is a deep connection with the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838290/extr